@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram

[*] --> RegistrationCheck
state RegistrationCheck <<choice>>
state PatientDashboard
state HealthWorkerDashboard
state GovernmentOfficialDashboard
state Logout

RegistrationCheck --> CompletedRegistration : registration completed
CompletedRegistration --> PatientDashboard : enter as patient
PatientDashboard --> ProvideInfo : provide medical information
ProvideInfo --> AnalyzeInfo : check and use info
AnalyzeInfo --> PrepareAlerts : prepare alerts
PrepareAlerts --> SendAlerts : send to patient or health worker

RegistrationCheck --> CompletedRegistration : registration completed
CompletedRegistration --> HealthWorkerDashboard : enter as health worker
HealthWorkerDashboard --> CheckInfo : check medical information
AnalyzeInfo --> PrepareAlerts : prepare alerts  // removed duplicate transition label

RegistrationCheck --> CompletedRegistration : registration completed
CompletedRegistration --> GovernmentOfficialDashboard : enter as government official
GovernmentOfficialDashboard --> DisplayResults : display planning results
DisplayResults --> Logout : logout

Logout --> [*] : logged out

@enduml
